@aelluswamy The biggest takeaway from this ~10x Houston Robotaxi expansion: the new geofence now covers the Texas Medical Center, River Oaks, Galleria, and West University Place.

These dense, high-activity areas generate the bulk of short urban trips (medical visits, shopping, local errands). Much better utilization than the old northwest suburban zone.

Can’t wait to see golden Cybercabs all over the Medical Center.

