In Austin, comparing @Robotaxi to @Waymo is like comparing apples to oranges. They are not the same.

Tesla owns and operates the Robotaxi network. In Austin, Waymo runs on @Uber's network, and Uber controls the app and the dispatch.

@gbrulte and @RobGsix analyze the comparison and what it means for both companies on Autonomy Signals presented by @KPMG.

🚨 One Tesla Robotaxi ride in Houston: 74.1 miles, 3 hours 5 minutes, $133.25 🚗

@scotsrule08 went from the north edge of the new geofence to the south edge and back, no interstate, and called it "absolutely flawless."

That's ~$1.80/mile. The zone expanded through downtown Oct 26.
